      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Katta Castrum: Deluge [zone=1016]\n**Who:**\n- Alchemist Hesia [npc=47711]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Water Logged Tome [item=119558]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a shissar arbiter [npc=47889]\n- a shissar necromancer [npc=47893]\n- a shissar revenant [npc=47894]\n- a shissar shadowslither [npc=47895]\n**Era:** | !The Darkened Sea\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sun Oct 26 03:22:49 2014\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 |\n---\n\n**The Darkened Sea Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This solo task begins with Alchemist Hesia ( **click for map image**) in Katta Castrum: Deluge. She's found at /loc 90, -70, 11 (in the northeastern corner of the temple's main floor)._\n_Pre-Requisites for Requesting:_\n\\- None\n_Say \"saved\" to request the task._\nYou say, 'Hail, Alchemist Hesia'\nAlchemist Hesia blinks at you with a vacant look in her eyes. She's clearly exhausted. 'Can't talk... have to organize these [books]. Don't want to lose any more.'\nYou say, 'What books?'\nAlchemist Hesia says 'Yes, so many books lost. Books full of...words. The shissar took over the library. Who knows what they'll manage to steal from its tomes. So much knowledge in those pages. It must be [saved].'\nYou say, 'Saved?'\nAlchemist Hesia says 'There is much of the magical arts that the shissar have not yet mastered. If they're allowed to learn all the secrets of the library... Everyone else seems so preoccupied with staying alive! Which I suppose is understandable.... Not us though, right \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_? We can see the forest for the trees! You'll help me keep the tomes out of the shissar hands, right? By the way, you know how to swim, right...?'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Library Aquatic'.\nAlchemist Hesia needs you to recover tomes from the royal library.\nThe shissar have taken over the building, so be careful. You'll need to go diving to reach the teleporter inside of the library.\n\n---\n\n!\n\n---\n\nSalvage whatever books you can from the combine library 0/10 (Katta Castrum: Deluge)\n_Loot 10x \"Water Logged Tome\" from shissar mobs in the library (common drop), or pick them up as ground spawns._\n_Four ground spawns in the library (about a two-minute respawn timer):_\n\\- bottom floor, far northeast corner\n\\- bottom floor, far southwest corner\n\\- top floor, far northwest corner\n\\- top floor, far southeast corner\n_If you don't have the task, you may pre-loot the books if someone else in your group is at this step of the task._\n\n---\n\nDeliver the salvaged tomes to Alchemist Hesia 0/10 (Katta Castrum: Deluge)\nSpeak with Alchemist Hesia 0/1 (Katta Castrum: Deluge)\nYou say, 'Hail, Alchemist Hesia'\nAlchemist Hesia nods happily at the stack of wet books you hand over to her. 'The Combine owes you a great deal \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. The shissar have been denied at least a little of the knowledge of the library.' A fairly large puddle is beginning to form at your feet as the books continue to drip. Hesia says, 'I suppose I should decide how I'm going to dry these....'\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\n22 platinum, 5 gold",
    },
