      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Katta Castrum: Deluge [zone=1016]\n**Who:**\n- Tactician Sodut [npc=47709]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a darkmud slave [npc=47885]\n- a darkmud watcher [npc=47884]\n- a flame whisperer [npc=47887]\n- a fright funnel [npc=47888]\n- a vortex of the deep [npc=47899]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Tactician Sodut #2: Bury the Head [quest=7733]\n**Era:** | !The Darkened Sea\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sun Oct 26 03:23:14 2014\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 |\n---\n\n**The Darkened Sea Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This solo task begins with Tactician Sodut ( **click for map image**) in Katta Castrum: Deluge. He's found at /loc 265, -15, 1 (just down the ramp extending out of the temple)._\n_Pre-Requisites for Requesting:_\n\\- None\n_Say \"help\" to request the task._\nYou say, 'Hail, Tactician Sodut'\nTactician Sodut says 'Wait, what are you doing here!? You're from the surface! How did you get down here, none of the portals are working. Nevermind, we'll discuss it later. Right now I need your [help] before the whole city collapses into the sea! By the gods, where's Captain Parvus! We could really use him right now.'\nYou say, 'I will help'\nTactician Sodut says 'All the mages are working desperately to keep the dome over our heads together, and that's left all of their supposed minions to run amok through the city. We're barely keeping them and those blasted shissar out of the temple, I don't have the men to run them down across the city. \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_, we need you to go out there and stop them before they turn the city to rubble.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Elemental Rage'.\nThe elementals have gone rogue and they're attacking anyone they encounter while destroying the city. Destroy as many as you can before they cause more deaths.\n\n---\n\nKill rogue elementals 0/10 (Katta Castrum: Deluge)\n_Any elementals count towards this step. (Note that \"a darkwater eddy\" mobs don't classify as elementals.)_\n\n---\n\nSpeak with Tactician Sodut 0/1 (Katta Castrum: Deluge)\nTactician Sodut says 'Well done, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_! There are now far fewer elementals on the rampage. Although I fear it may not matter if we can't find a way to fix the [real problem].'\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\n52 platinum, 5 gold",
